--[[
    Ping / FPS / Kills HUD
    ------------------------------------------------------------
    ASSUMPTIONS (adjust if wrong, then tell me and I'll fix them):
      1. "Monthly Kills" / "Total Kills" come from:
             player.leaderstats["Monthly Kills"]
             player.leaderstats["Total Kills"]
         -> see getLeaderboardStats() below if this needs to change.
      2. "game id" means game.PlaceId (not game.GameId / universe id).
      3. FPS value of exactly 10 falls into the 11-20 bracket
         (your ranges had a gap between "<10" and "11-20").
      4. The old killstreak counter's spot now holds a Session Kills counter
         (Total Kills minus a baseline captured when leaderstats first load)
         and a session stopwatch. The stopwatch counts up from the very
         first line of this script (before any GetService calls or the
         PlayerGui wait), as close an approximation of "time since joining
         this server" as a client-only script can get — Roblox doesn't
         expose the actual server-join timestamp to client scripts, so this
         is still exact only if the script auto-executes right at join; a
         manual/delayed execution will start the count from execution time
         regardless. Session Kills has its own toggle in Settings, under
         "Display LB Stats."

    Ping/FPS refresh live (~once per second). Kills refresh instantly
    whenever the leaderstats values change. The countdown was removed.
    The main box is draggable and the settings panel follows it.
    ------------------------------------------------------------
]]

