-- avoidable slack between "script starts running" and "stopwatch starts
-- counting." It still can't reflect the actual server-join moment if this
-- is executed manually well after joining -- Roblox doesn't expose a join
-- timestamp to client scripts, so closing that gap would require a
-- server-side script broadcasting the real join time back to the client.
